    "body": "The braces were system-font fallbacks. FF8's menu font does not contain `{` or `}`, but it does contain its own `「` and `」` glyphs. The Enemies list and detail heading now display the two special records as `「Rinoa」` and `「Griever」`. Their source names and saved data remain unchanged.\n\nThe rendered check confirms that the full displayed names use the FF8 Menu font.",
